  "foaf:name": "Biofábrica de Corais: Integrated Reef Restoration",
  "sdo:name": "Biofábrica de Corais: Integrated Reef Restoration",
  "sdo:description": "The Biofábrica de Corais promotes the resilience and restoration of reef ecosystems through innovative biotechnological technologies and a multidisciplinary approach, integrating the needs of local communities. The project strengthens global and local marine conservation capacities, aligning with Objectives 1, 3, and 5 of Marine Life 2030. Through strategic partnerships and knowledge dissemination, we aim to contribute to the sustainable development of the oceans and the well-being of coastal populations, promoting replicable solutions for reef conservation.",
